  "_about": "Independent fan sites' feeds for each club (Salah, 2026-11-26: \"We also should be pulling from team fan sites\"): { <club id>: [{ name, url }] }. Read by scripts/api/news.mjs like the Guardian's club feeds: every story is about that club, goes in news/<club>.json only (never the general headlines), and is credited to the site by name. Only the headline, a short summary and the link are kept; a story is read on the site. Each feed was checked by hand: 200, RSS or Atom, recent items, robots.txt allows it. No betting-owned sites, and no sites of networks owned by betting companies or founded in Israel (FanSided, Minute Media; Vital Football left out for its owner's past betting venture). 71 clubs on 2026-11-26, each feed fetched and checked: 200, RSS or Atom, 5 or more items, newest within 30 days, robots.txt allows it.",
